title: "Anthropology of the Singularity research infrastructure"
type: software
version: "0.1.0-draft"
authors:
  - name: "Singularity Studies"
repository-code: "https://github.com/singularity-studies/anthropology"
abstract: >-
  Ethics-first, versioned infrastructure for longitudinal ethnography of lived
  human transition in AI-mediated sociotechnical systems. This scaffold contains
  no participant data, field-site data, ethnographic claims, or findings.
